WEBVTT

00:45.840 --> 00:47.719
How did you know it was me?

02:56.199 --> 02:57.560
Who's there?

03:01.759 --> 03:04.960
- I win again.
- How did you know it was me, Daddy?

03:05.039 --> 03:07.680
Don't you know?
I've got eyes in the back of my head.

03:07.759 --> 03:10.879
- No, you don't.
- What's with the scary mask you got on?

03:10.960 --> 03:12.240
It's an oni.

03:13.280 --> 03:15.719
I heard they're scary demons from Japan.

03:16.080 --> 03:20.240
He got that as a gift from a friend.
It was a souvenir from a trip.

03:20.599 --> 03:22.199
Your face is an absolute mess.

03:22.280 --> 03:24.599
Oni are big baddies.
And they're mean.

03:24.680 --> 03:26.280
They might show up
thinking you're one of them

03:26.360 --> 03:28.599
if you keep on wearing that crazy mask.

03:28.680 --> 03:30.960
They're really scary.
Can you beat them all up for me?

03:31.039 --> 03:32.960
Well, they sure look like
they're big baddies to me.

03:33.039 --> 03:34.360
Come on.
You think I can take them?

03:34.439 --> 03:35.439
- No.
- Don't worry.

03:35.520 --> 03:39.280
Everything will be fine, because Mommy
is gonna take them out for you.

03:39.360 --> 03:41.560
- Can you really?
- Yes, really.

03:42.000 --> 03:44.719
Okay, then, I guess Daddy's going
to keep working on the motorcycle,

03:44.800 --> 03:47.000
so we can run away when Mommy
gets in over her head.

03:47.360 --> 03:48.919
- Want to help me?
- Yeah!

03:49.000 --> 03:51.800
No, I don't want you getting
your clothes dirty again.

03:51.879 --> 03:54.520
Come on. And make sure
you're home in time for dinner, honey.

03:54.599 --> 03:56.000
And hurry up! We don't have--

03:57.800 --> 03:58.960
Geez!

04:04.960 --> 04:07.960
<i>Now, for our next story,
the suspect in the brutal murder</i>

04:08.039 --> 04:11.560
<i>that happened in El Balkeen
on the 10th is still at large.</i>

04:11.639 --> 04:14.479
<i>The victim's body
was lacerated multiple times</i>

04:14.560 --> 04:17.240
<i>with what appears to be
a very sharp object.</i>

04:17.319 --> 04:19.800
<i>Investigators say the injuries
would suggest</i>

04:19.879 --> 04:22.360
<i>there were at least five
perpetrators involved.</i>

04:22.439 --> 04:26.439
<i>Many are speculating the murder was
carried out by a criminal organization.</i>

04:27.000 --> 04:32.439
- Do you think it could be...
- Maybe it's the oni.

04:33.439 --> 04:35.319
The oni could do that.

04:39.680 --> 04:41.560
Okay, it's time for bed, son.

04:41.639 --> 04:43.839
- But I'm not sleepy.
- No buts.

04:44.360 --> 04:46.399
I hate it when you make that face, Daddy.

04:46.480 --> 04:48.600
Even your mom is saying
that it's past your bedtime.

04:50.920 --> 04:52.839
I love every face that Mommy makes.

04:53.199 --> 04:56.920
You better behave, or you won't be
getting a birthday present.

05:11.519 --> 05:12.439
What's wrong?

05:14.600 --> 05:18.319
It's that news from earlier.
You know, the way he was killed.

05:19.360 --> 05:20.439
Oh, Mari.

05:21.639 --> 05:23.600
Not to mention the victim.

05:23.680 --> 05:26.240
They have zero insight
into his personal life,

05:26.319 --> 05:29.519
even after interviewing a bunch of people
he worked with.

05:29.959 --> 05:32.279
That's not out of the ordinary
these days.

05:32.360 --> 05:34.639
Everything's fine.
No one's going to find us out here.

05:35.560 --> 05:38.199
Are you sure?
What about the Reaper?

05:38.279 --> 05:42.360
Don't worry about the Reaper.
Besides, this definitely wasn't his work.

05:43.120 --> 05:45.120
You know he always worked alone.

05:45.639 --> 05:49.120
Please just relax. It's smooth sailing
for us from here on out.

05:49.879 --> 05:50.920
Thanks, babe.

06:53.959 --> 06:55.759
Another horrific murder has occurred,

06:55.839 --> 06:58.800
<i>this time in a quiet residential area
of St. Mark's.</i>

06:59.160 --> 07:03.399
<i>This killing has the same characteristics
as the ones that took place in High Park,</i>

07:03.480 --> 07:07.439
<i>in Oleana, and the murder in Zamilan
on the seventh of this month.</i>

07:07.519 --> 07:11.480
<i>Authorities are currently saying that we
may have a serial killer on our hands.</i>

07:11.560 --> 07:13.720
<i>While a large-scale
investigation is now under way,</i>

07:14.160 --> 07:15.480
things don't look too hopeful,

07:15.560 --> 07:17.720
<i>as there are still no clues
or connections</i>

07:17.800 --> 07:19.199
<i>that have been established
between the victims.</i>

07:19.279 --> 07:21.199
Hear that?
That's the fourth one.

07:32.720 --> 07:34.600
You burned it. It's all black again.

07:35.480 --> 07:39.439
That's great. There goes your dad
screwing things up yet again.

07:39.519 --> 07:41.959
That's why I said
you should let me handle it.

07:42.040 --> 07:45.399
Thicker cuts of meat
can be a challenge to grill.

07:50.560 --> 07:51.680
Yeah!

07:52.199 --> 07:54.199
All right! It's a Triger cake!

07:54.680 --> 07:56.560
Do you think you can blow them all out?

08:21.839 --> 08:23.279
Oh, boy! What is it?

08:23.959 --> 08:26.519
- Yay! Video games!
- And a little bonus.

08:29.240 --> 08:32.879
You know, I like seeing you in this mask
way more than that scary oni one.

08:32.960 --> 08:36.360
And I don't want to be a baddie.
I like being the hero.

08:37.279 --> 08:39.960
Well, I prefer seeing this face.

08:40.720 --> 08:41.720
Here we go.

08:41.799 --> 08:46.480
Sure looks like Mommy is using more of
her dirty tricks to get on your good side.

08:47.000 --> 08:50.240
I love you, the both of you.

08:53.600 --> 08:54.799
Love you, too.

09:07.080 --> 09:08.399
Honey?

09:09.440 --> 09:12.559
Don't worry, babe, just stay put.

09:50.039 --> 09:50.960
Daddy!

10:49.960 --> 10:52.480
She sure put up a good fight.

11:20.759 --> 11:23.240
They got here quick.
Who ratted?

12:45.720 --> 12:48.080
Get the doctor! Hurry!

12:49.440 --> 12:52.440
- Are you okay? Can you hear me, sir?
- Mari.

12:53.799 --> 12:55.960
- Ren.
- Mr. Logan!

12:56.039 --> 12:58.519
Mr. Logan, can you hear me?

12:58.600 --> 13:00.879
Mr. Logan! Mr. Logan!

13:07.879 --> 13:09.320
Please remain calm.

13:09.639 --> 13:12.159
Do you understand what happened
to you, why you're here?

13:14.159 --> 13:18.759
You miraculously came back to life after
the coroner had pronounced you dead.

13:18.840 --> 13:21.559
What about my wife and son?

13:22.639 --> 13:25.159
I'm afraid they didn't make it.

13:30.279 --> 13:33.159
Well, it's been 24 hours since
he was pronounced dead.

13:33.519 --> 13:35.919
You seriously think
this dude came back to life?

13:36.240 --> 13:38.879
I don't know,
maybe he's not even human anymore.

13:40.159 --> 13:41.159
That's just great.

13:41.919 --> 13:44.440
Well, let's go meet Mr. Zombie.

13:44.519 --> 13:46.639
That goes into his room.

13:47.919 --> 13:50.440
Please don't agitate him too much.

13:51.879 --> 13:52.919
Of course.

13:53.639 --> 13:56.679
Hello, Mr. Logan.
I'm Mike Moriss with the FBI.

13:57.200 --> 13:58.799
And I'm Emma Samanda.

13:58.879 --> 14:01.000
Pardon us for bothering you
at such a difficult time,

14:01.799 --> 14:03.919
but we'd like your help
with our investigation.

14:04.919 --> 14:07.559
Can you remember who broke in
to your home and attacked your family?

14:08.679 --> 14:11.559
Any thoughts or ideas
as to what the motives were?

14:12.240 --> 14:14.159
Anything you could tell us would help.

14:21.879 --> 14:25.399
Please feel free to contact me
if anything comes to mind.

14:29.480 --> 14:34.440
That guy back there,
he probably knows who did this.

14:34.759 --> 14:36.600
It's just a hunch.

14:37.519 --> 14:41.240
But just in case, we'll take turns
watching over him tonight.

14:42.919 --> 14:43.840
Roger that.

14:46.840 --> 14:50.879
Yep, he's been up on the roof
just sitting there for a while now.

14:50.960 --> 14:53.879
Okay, I won't make any moves
without your permission.

14:53.960 --> 14:55.440
Yeah. Roger.

15:03.960 --> 15:07.799
Would you care to say goodbye
to your family?

16:15.720 --> 16:17.039
What the hell's going on?

17:25.160 --> 17:28.000
Damn it! Why isn't she picking up
the damn phone?

17:28.079 --> 17:30.200
What the hell is she doing?

17:32.200 --> 17:34.319
Holy crap. What the hell?

17:46.240 --> 17:48.440
Just wouldn't die, would you?

18:38.440 --> 18:41.839
How did you know where to find us?
How did you know it was me?

18:42.839 --> 18:45.799
You can go ahead and change
your appearance all you want.

18:46.480 --> 18:48.880
It doesn't matter how you try to hide.

18:48.960 --> 18:52.119
There is no way
you'll ever escape your fate.

21:18.000 --> 21:22.920
Subtitling
FAST TITLES MEDIA
